ia.org/wiki/Kyngstonn_Viliamu-Asa"},"pick":{"pick":36,"round":2,"team":"NYJ","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Kyngstonn Viliamu-Asa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyngstonn_Viliamu-Asa","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Kyngstonn Saisola Opele Niupulusu Viliamu-Asa (born March 16, 2006), also known by his initials KVA, is an American college football linebacker for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Viliamu-Asa attended St. John Bosco High School in Bellflower, California. He was a five-star recruit according to Rivals.com."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Viliamu-Asa committed to play college football for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish over offers from Ohio State and USC."}]}}